  "prefLabel": "En 510.10 Department Action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 510.10 Department Action.\n\n(a) The NOV shall become final and the department shall act upon it unless the respondent requests a hearing pursuant to En 510.09(b).\n\n(b) The department shall forward hearing requests pursuant to En 510.09(b) to the commission.\n\nSource. #13796, eff 10-25-23",
